 75  Gc  have changed little in content.                                        
 75   c  COMM$The statistical analysis of |g-ray data and deduced level schemes 
 75  2c  is carried out through computer codes available at data center in      
 75  3c  Brookhaven (www.nndc.bnl.gov). Theoretical conversion coefficients are 
 75  4c  from BrIcc code: v2.2b (20-Jan-2009) (2008Ki07) with "Frozen Orbitals" 
 75  5c  approximation, and with implicit uncertainty of 1.4%. All Q values are 
 75  6c  from 2012Wa38. In many cases weighted averages are taken using the so  
 75  7c  called Limitation of Relative Statistical Weights (LRSW) method. The   
 75  8c  assigned uncertainty in the recommended result is generally not lower  
 75  9c  than the lowest uncertainty in the dataset that is being averaged.     
